Objective

Exploit a client-side prototype pollution vulnerability to achieve DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting (XSS).

The objective was to:

Identify a source capable of modifying Object.prototype.
Identify a JavaScript gadget that uses a property inherited from the prototype.
Control the value of the gadget through prototype pollution.
Reach a DOM XSS sink.
Execute arbitrary JavaScript using alert(1).
